		{
			description: [
				"A network is a controller, some cable, and devices touching that cable."
				""
				"Storage lives on cells in a drive. Everything is measured in channels:"
				"each device uses one, and a controller supplies thirty-two per face."
				"Run out and things stop working with no error."
				""
				"Dense cable carries thirty-two channels, normal cable carries eight."
			]
